          ],
          "content": "Community acquired pneumonia, right lower lobe. Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, moderate. Current smoker."
        },
        {
          "label": "paragraph_title",
          "order": 4,
          "score": 0.7982035279273987,
          "bbox": [
            70.0,
